,"end":136.88}]},{"id":5,"speaker":"dante","text":"Master,\" I said, \"among people like these\nI should surely recognize some\nwho were infected with these diseases.","startTime":136.88,"endTime":144.08,"words":[{"word":"Master,\"","start":137.12,"end":138},{"word":"I","start":138,"end":138.08},{"word":"said,","start":138.08,"end":138.8},{"word":"\"among","start":138.8,"end":139.2},{"word":"people","start":139.2,"end":139.56},{"word":"like","start":139.56,"end":139.76},{"word":"these","start":139.76,"end":140.24},{"word":"I","start":140.24,"end":140.453},{"word":"should","start":140.453,"end":140.68},{"word":"surely","start":140.68,"end":141.16},{"word":"recognize","start":141.16,"end":141.72},{"word":"some","start":141.72,"end":141.92},{"word":"who","start":141.92,"end":142.04},{"word":"were","start":142.04,"end":142.16},{"word":"infected","start":142.16,"end":142.8},{"word":"with","start":142.8,"end":142.96},{"word":"these","start":142.96,"end":143.12},{"word":"diseases.","start":143.12,"end":144.08}]},{"id":6,"speaker":"virgil","text":"You entertain a useless thought,\" he replied.\n\"The unthinking life that made them filthy\nnow makes them beyond all recognition.\nForever they will come to these collisions—\nthese will rise from their graves with fists clenched,\nthose others with their hair shorn off.\nPoor giving and poor keeping have stolen\nthe beautiful world from them\nand set them in this brawl—\nI won't waste pretty words describing it.\nNow you can see, my son, the fleeting comedy\nof goods entrusted to Fortune,\nfor which humanity battles one another.\nAll the gold that lies beneath the moon,\nor ever existed, could not give\na moment's rest to even one of these weary souls.","startTime":144.08,"endTime":189.44,"words":[{"word":"You","start":144.08,"end":144.4},{"word":"entertain","start":144.4,"end":145.04},{"word":"a","start":145.04,"end":145.28},{"word":"useless","start":145.28,"end":145.84},{"word":"thought,\"","start":145.84,"end":146.64},{"word